Identity is in Logic, but it is part of the intrusion of mathematics, which=
 dominated the developments from mid 19th to mid 20th centuries.  So it is =
not particularly logic.  Since 1965 or so the intrusions have come more fro=
m Linguistics, but there is no good way to show that either, and it wouldn'=
t be appropriate, sine what is in Lojban was already in place before then.

Sent from my iPad

